            "rows": null,
            "style": "IPY_MODEL_1c15369d89cb4c9aaa71019b13d6d932",
            "value": "The business objective is to generate meaningful information to accurately predict the rental prices accross various location in Australia. This experiment will use ElasticNet to train model for prediction, analyze the results and outcomes, with the goal of supporting the landlords and propert management company in making informed rental pricing decisions base on features such as location, floor area, number of bedrooms, and other relevant characteristics. By appplying machine learning techniques, the project aims to provide valuable insights for the investment decision, and improve the pricing strategies in the market.  "
