            "rows": null,
            "style": "IPY_MODEL_15c29000ac124a78b7079f60bd71f6a5",
            "value": "The linear regression is so simple to accurately predict this dataset. Therefore, more complex models or additional features could further improve predictive power.\n\nBecause this dataset is not perfectly linear, but there is enough linear pattern that a linear model like ElasticNet, therefore, we should try ElasticNet model for this experiment. ElasticNet, a regularized linear model that combines both L1 (Lasso) and L2 (Ridge) penalties, is chosen to improve upon Linear Regression by handling multicollinearity and reducing overfitting."
          }
        },
